  m_Text: 'W A S D / Arrows  Move                  Mouse       Look

    Shift                   
    Sprint                 E              Context action / carry / drop

    B                        
    Construction       T              Business tablet

    R                        
    Rotate preview   Left Click   Place object

    Delete                  Sell
    selected       F2 / `        Admin console

    F5                       Save                   
    F9            Load

    H                         Controls              Esc          
    Pause / back


    FIRST FARM: Buy supplies from the tablet, wait for delivery,
    then use Tablet > Inventory

    to place equipment. Plant, care for, harvest,
    dry, store, and sell your crop.'
