  m_Text: 'MOVEMENT

    W A S D / Arrow Keys  -  Move

    Mouse  -  Look

    Left
    Shift  -  Sprint


    FARMING AND CARRYING

    E  -  Perform the action shown
    near the crosshair

    E  -  Pick up or drop a carried object

    Plant care
    automatically uses owned tools/supplies


    GENERAL

    T  -  Open / close
    the business tablet

    H  -  Open the pause-menu controls reference

    Esc 
    -  Pause / back

    F5  -  Save locally

    F9  -  Load local save

    F2
    or `  -  Admin console'
